      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASH ROSE (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Southern Star (22.89) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Sure to be about the mark. SUNSET AGRIPPINA (4) is a promising dog in the frame at eight of 23 starts including eight wins and was a last start winner (22.68) over 400m at this track. Performs well off this draw. Has the ability and rates a key chance this line-up. JUST A DUKE (5) was safely held in tougher company last start after settling well back at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (27.86) beating Flame On in a Novice race on July 17. Bold showing expected. SPEEDY ED (7) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
